{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "nwb-wegvakken",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "All 1,603,227 road segments (wegvakken) of the Dutch [Nationaal Wegenbestand](https://nationaalwegenbestand.nl/): every public road with a street name or road number, managed by Rijk, provincie, gemeente, waterschap or particulier (wegbeheerdersoort R/P/G/W/T). Includes street names, route numbers, hectometer references, house-number ranges, junction ids and [OpenLR](https://www.openlr.org/) codes, in native RD New (EPSG:28992). Snapshot with wegvak versions through 2026-02-01; upstream NWB is published by [Rijkswaterstaat](https://data.overheid.nl/dataset/14767-nwb---wegen) 12 times per year under CC0. Attribute semantics are documented in the [NWB handbook](https://docs.ndw.nu/handleidingen/nwb/); join keys and runnable queries are in the collection's [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).",
